    {
      "subId": "7050402",
      "subQuestName": "Mix Rosaria the specified drink",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705040201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705040201": {
            "id": "705040201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040202"
            ]
          },
          "705040202": {
            "id": "705040202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it, Rosaria? You don't like the drink?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040203"
            ]
          },
          "705040203": {
            "id": "705040203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I can make you another one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040204"
            ]
          },
          "705040204": {
            "id": "705040204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "No, the drink you made me is fine. It's just that I rarely ever drink tea. The taste always reminds me of certain... things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040205"
            ]
          },
          "705040205": {
            "id": "705040205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Ah, I presume you're referring to the church?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040206"
            ]
          },
          "705040206": {
            "id": "705040206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Yes. The church once held an event that I couldn't attend, but Sister Barbara still saved some tea and dessert for me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040207"
            ]
          },
          "705040207": {
            "id": "705040207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "The dessert had already gone stale, so she whisked it away when I wasn't looking, but the tea tasted just like this drink you made me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040208"
            ]
          },
          "705040208": {
            "id": "705040208",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Boy, you're in rare form today, Rosaria.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040209"
            ]
          },
          "705040209": {
            "id": "705040209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Sounds to me like Mondstadt's just gained another black tea lover.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040210"
            ]
          },
          "705040210": {
            "id": "705040210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Heh, I'd prefer something a little stiffer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040211"
            ]
          },
          "705040211": {
            "id": "705040211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What about you, Kaeya? How's your drink?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040212"
            ]
          },
          "705040212": {
            "id": "705040212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "That depends. If I point out a few flaws, will you make me another one?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040213"
            ]
          },
          "705040213": {
            "id": "705040213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hahaha, I'm just kidding. I'd never subject you to such treatment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040214"
            ]
          },
          "705040214": {
            "id": "705040214",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gosh, Kaeya sure is a tough nut to crack, you never know what he'll say next. How can you stand to drink with this guy, Rosaria?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040215"
            ]
          },
          "705040215": {
            "id": "705040215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Hmm? I don't really care what's going through his mind, as long as we only talk about drinks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040216"
            ]
          },
          "705040216": {
            "id": "705040216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Besides, Kaeya's only interested in people or things that intrigue him, whether that's you, the innkeeper here, or anybody else...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040217"
            ]
          },
          "705040217": {
            "id": "705040217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hey! How could you divulge so much about your dear old drinking buddy, hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040218"
            ]
          },
          "705040218": {
            "id": "705040218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "You think I'm saying too much? Heh, get over yourself, it's no big deal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040219"
            ]
          },
          "705040219": {
            "id": "705040219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Ugh, I'm constantly surrounded by uptight folks day-to-day. I prefer the easygoing atmosphere in the tavern.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040220"
            ]
          },
          "705040220": {
            "id": "705040220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Ooh, are we gossiping about people who take themselves too seriously, now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040221"
            ]
          },
          "705040221": {
            "id": "705040221",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Speaking of which, I know someone who could easily place in the \"Top Three Most Serious People in Mondstadt.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040222"
            ]
          },
          "705040222": {
            "id": "705040222",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "As to their level of seriousness... Well, let me put it this way, they probably wouldn't even flinch if I said that to their face.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040223"
            ]
          },
          "705040223": {
            "id": "705040223",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are there really rankings for people like that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040224"
            ]
          },
          "705040224": {
            "id": "705040224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Of course. Just off the top of my head, there's a running list for the most consistent drinkers, hardest workers, worst cooks, or even... biggest hoarders of dark secrets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040225"
            ]
          },
          "705040225": {
            "id": "705040225",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds to Paimon like Mondstadters have way too much time on their hands!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040226"
            ]
          },
          "705040226": {
            "id": "705040226",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Are there really that many people who don't need to work?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040229"
            ]
          },
          "705040229": {
            "id": "705040229",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Aww, but what about Paimon? Is there a category that Paimon can be ranked as high as {F#her}{M#him}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040230"
            ]
          },
          "705040230": {
            "id": "705040230",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Why, of course. How about, \"Best Bartenders\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040231"
            ]
          },
          "705040231": {
            "id": "705040231",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "R—Really!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040232"
            ]
          },
          "705040232": {
            "id": "705040232",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#That's great, {NICKNAME}! Our names will be remembered together forever!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040233"
            ]
          },
          "705040233": {
            "id": "705040233",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Heh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040234"
            ]
          },
          "705040234": {
            "id": "705040234",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Well, I must admit, the atmosphere you bring isn't half bad.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040235"
            ]
          },
          "705040235": {
            "id": "705040235",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "You can say that again. Just looking at these two brings a smile to my face.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040236"
            ]
          },
          "705040236": {
            "id": "705040236",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Good bartenders create a nice atmosphere and get people in a good mood. You know, like a mascot... so I guess there's really no contest for the title of \"Best Bartenders.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040237"
            ]
          },
          "705040237": {
            "id": "705040237",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040238"
            ]
          },
          "705040238": {
            "id": "705040238",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Heh, nothing. Thanks for your hospitality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040239"
            ]
          },
          "705040239": {
            "id": "705040239",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "Yeah, I should be going, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040240"
            ]
          },
          "705040240": {
            "id": "705040240",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "By the way, that black tea tasted great. I'll try to make some for myself in the future... if I can manage to get up early enough in the morning, that is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040241"
            ]
          },
          "705040241": {
            "id": "705040241",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Until next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705040242"
            ]
          },
          "705040242": {
            "id": "705040242",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Please come again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
